{"lines": [{"text": "Imagine you wake up one morning, and your body has simply... stopped aging.", "start": 0.8, "end": 6.392, "spec": {"shot": "wake", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Imagine", 0.094, 0.524], ["you", 0.524, 0.659], ["wake", 0.659, 0.927], ["up", 0.927, 1.102], ["one", 1.116, 1.344], ["morning", 1.344, 1.895], ["and", 2.177, 2.298], ["your", 2.312, 2.406], ["body", 2.419, 2.836], ["has", 2.836, 3.011], ["simply", 3.024, 3.804], ["stopped", 4.019, 4.516], ["aging", 4.624, 5.188]]}, {"text": "No wrinkles. No gray hair. No back pain. Ever.", "start": 7.092, "end": 11.868, "spec": {"shot": "mirror", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["No", 0.094, 0.228], ["wrinkles", 0.229, 1.035], ["No", 1.465, 1.64], ["gray", 1.653, 1.935], ["hair", 1.935, 2.379], ["No", 2.796, 2.93], ["back", 2.93, 3.172], ["pain", 3.172, 3.548], ["Ever", 3.978, 4.368]]}, {"text": "At first, this is the best thing that has ever happened to you. You're basically a superhero.", "start": 12.568, "end": 18.52, "spec": {"shot": "hype", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.108, 0.215], ["first", 0.229, 0.86], ["this", 1.075, 1.25], ["is", 1.25, 1.344], ["the", 1.344, 1.452], ["best", 1.452, 1.761], ["thing", 1.761, 2.016], ["that", 2.016, 2.124], ["has", 2.124, 2.392], ["ever", 2.554, 2.782], ["happened", 2.782, 3.159], ["to", 3.159, 3.28], ["you", 3.28, 3.575], ["You're", 4.005, 4.099], ["basically", 4.099, 4.61], ["a", 4.61, 4.677], ["superhero", 4.691, 5.551]]}, {"text": "This is your life if you never aged.", "start": 19.22, "end": 21.908, "spec": {"shot": "title", "era": "title", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["This", 0.121, 0.296], ["is", 0.296, 0.39], ["your", 0.39, 0.511], ["life", 0.524, 1.089], ["if", 1.277, 1.371], ["you", 1.371, 1.452], ["never", 1.452, 1.828], ["aged", 1.828, 2.312]]}, {"text": "The first thing you notice is that the pressure is gone. No more, I'm getting too old for this. No ticking clock. Ever.", "start": 22.608, "end": 30.792, "spec": {"shot": "nopressure", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 1 · AGE 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.188], ["first", 0.202, 0.457], ["thing", 0.457, 0.605], ["you", 0.605, 0.699], ["notice", 0.712, 1.277], ["is", 1.465, 1.613], ["that", 1.613, 1.734], ["the", 1.734, 1.815], ["pressure", 1.815, 2.258], ["is", 2.258, 2.366], ["gone", 2.379, 2.769], ["No", 3.186, 3.32], ["more", 3.32, 3.669], ["I'm", 4.207, 4.288], ["getting", 4.288, 4.476], ["too", 4.489, 4.704], ["old", 4.718, 4.919], ["for", 4.933, 5.067], ["this", 5.081, 5.511], ["No", 5.927, 6.116], ["ticking", 6.116, 6.613], ["clock", 6.613, 7.016], ["Ever", 7.446, 7.809]]}, {"text": "You sleep in. You take a year off. Nobody can tell you that you're wasting your life, because you literally can't.", "start": 31.492, "end": 38.908, "spec": {"shot": "sleepin", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.188], ["sleep", 0.202, 0.524], ["in", 0.538, 0.753], ["You", 1.196, 1.25], ["take", 1.263, 1.411], ["a", 1.411, 1.438], ["year", 1.452, 1.694], ["off", 1.707, 2.07], ["Nobody", 2.487, 2.836], ["can", 2.849, 2.984], ["tell", 2.997, 3.239], ["you", 3.253, 3.414], ["that", 3.414, 3.535], ["you're", 3.535, 3.683], ["wasting", 3.683, 4.18], ["your", 4.18, 4.315], ["life", 4.314, 4.825], ["because", 5.094, 5.484], ["you", 5.497, 5.685], ["literally", 5.699, 6.371], ["can't", 6.452, 7.03]]}, {"text": "So you learn everything. French. Then Spanish. Then Japanese.", "start": 39.608, "end": 45.32, "spec": {"shot": "learn", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 2 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.202], ["you", 0.202, 0.349], ["learn", 0.349, 0.632], ["everything", 0.645, 1.25], ["French", 1.774, 2.245], ["Then", 2.688, 2.957], ["Spanish", 2.957, 3.643], ["Then", 4.073, 4.301], ["Japanese", 4.462, 5.323]]}, {"text": "You learn the piano, the guitar, and how to cook pretty much anything. You read every book you ever wanted to read.", "start": 46.02, "end": 53.148, "spec": {"shot": "skills", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 4 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.228], ["learn", 0.229, 0.403], ["the", 0.403, 0.484], ["piano", 0.497, 1.237], ["the", 1.452, 1.559], ["guitar", 1.559, 2.137], ["and", 2.46, 2.513], ["how", 2.513, 2.608], ["to", 2.608, 2.702], ["cook", 2.715, 2.957], ["pretty", 2.97, 3.185], ["much", 3.186, 3.414], ["anything", 3.427, 3.884], ["You", 4.314, 4.476], ["read", 4.476, 4.771], ["every", 4.946, 5.215], ["book", 5.229, 5.497], ["you", 5.497, 5.699], ["ever", 5.847, 6.102], ["wanted", 6.102, 6.317], ["to", 6.317, 6.371], ["read", 6.384, 6.747]]}, {"text": "You travel to every single country on Earth. Not on some rushed two-week vacation. You live in each one for a while.", "start": 53.848, "end": 61.768, "spec": {"shot": "travel", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 6 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.202], ["travel", 0.215, 0.672], ["to", 0.672, 0.806], ["every", 0.981, 1.344], ["single", 1.358, 1.694], ["country", 1.707, 2.056], ["on", 2.056, 2.191], ["Earth", 2.204, 2.607], ["Not", 3.051, 3.212], ["on", 3.212, 3.387], ["some", 3.401, 3.683], ["rushed", 3.683, 4.207], ["two-week", 4.328, 4.839], ["vacation", 4.839, 5.511], ["You", 5.954, 6.048], ["live", 6.062, 6.223], ["in", 6.223, 6.304], ["each", 6.304, 6.479], ["one", 6.479, 6.801], ["for", 6.814, 7.003], ["a", 7.003, 7.056], ["while", 7.056, 7.527]]}, {"text": "You take every risk. Start a business, fail, start another one. Who cares? You can try again a hundred times.", "start": 62.468, "end": 70.628, "spec": {"shot": "risks", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 7 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.094, 0.175], ["take", 0.175, 0.403], ["every", 0.538, 0.82], ["risk", 0.82, 1.317], ["Start", 1.734, 1.989], ["a", 1.989, 2.043], ["business", 2.043, 2.661], ["fail", 2.755, 3.266], ["start", 3.522, 3.79], ["another", 3.79, 4.086], ["one", 4.086, 4.368], ["Who", 4.798, 4.906], ["cares", 4.906, 5.524], ["You", 5.968, 6.035], ["can", 6.048, 6.129], ["try", 6.129, 6.411], ["again", 6.411, 6.761], ["a", 6.774, 6.801], ["hundred", 6.814, 7.151], ["times", 7.151, 7.782]]}, {"text": "Want to be a doctor, a pilot and a chef? Easy. Just become all of them, one after another.", "start": 71.328, "end": 78.192, "spec": {"shot": "careers", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 8 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Want", 0.067, 0.175], ["to", 0.175, 0.215], ["be", 0.229, 0.349], ["a", 0.349, 0.403], ["doctor", 0.417, 0.981], ["a", 1.452, 1.505], ["pilot", 1.519, 2.043], ["and", 2.164, 2.245], ["a", 2.245, 2.272], ["chef", 2.272, 2.823], ["Easy", 3.239, 3.696], ["Just", 4.126, 4.261], ["become", 4.261, 4.556], ["all", 4.556, 4.812], ["of", 4.812, 4.906], ["them", 4.906, 5.175], ["one", 5.47, 5.672], ["after", 5.672, 5.995], ["another", 5.995, 6.479]]}, {"text": "You even put a little money into the stock market and just leave it there. When you have decades to wait, compound interest becomes your best friend.", "start": 78.892, "end": 87.556, "spec": {"shot": "invest", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 8 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.094, 0.175], ["even", 0.175, 0.349], ["put", 0.349, 0.457], ["a", 0.47, 0.524], ["little", 0.538, 0.847], ["money", 0.847, 1.237], ["into", 1.237, 1.371], ["the", 1.384, 1.465], ["stock", 1.478, 1.868], ["market", 1.882, 2.312], ["and", 2.608, 2.688], ["just", 2.702, 2.903], ["leave", 2.903, 3.159], ["it", 3.159, 3.266], ["there", 3.28, 3.656], ["When", 4.086, 4.18], ["you", 4.194, 4.314], ["have", 4.314, 4.637], ["decades", 4.718, 5.242], ["to", 5.242, 5.336], ["wait", 5.336, 5.739], ["compound", 5.995, 6.519], ["interest", 6.519, 6.989], ["becomes", 7.003, 7.352], ["your", 7.366, 7.473], ["best", 7.487, 7.823], ["friend", 7.823, 8.28]]}, {"text": "Your friends are jealous. What's your secret, they ask. And you just smile.", "start": 88.256, "end": 93.296, "spec": {"shot": "envy", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 9 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.094, 0.175], ["friends", 0.175, 0.565], ["are", 0.578, 0.672], ["jealous", 0.672, 1.425], ["What's", 1.855, 1.989], ["your", 2.003, 2.11], ["secret", 2.11, 2.607], ["they", 2.621, 2.782], ["ask", 2.782, 3.293], ["And", 3.723, 3.79], ["you", 3.79, 3.898], ["just", 3.898, 4.14], ["smile", 4.14, 4.651]]}, {"text": "Life is perfect. You feel like you've beaten the game.", "start": 93.996, "end": 97.356, "spec": {"shot": "king", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 9 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Life", 0.108, 0.363], ["is", 0.363, 0.484], ["perfect", 0.484, 1.116], ["You", 1.559, 1.64], ["feel", 1.653, 1.801], ["like", 1.815, 1.976], ["you've", 1.976, 2.191], ["beaten", 2.191, 2.473], ["the", 2.487, 2.554], ["game", 2.554, 2.957]]}, {"text": "But then, slowly, the problems start.", "start": 98.056, "end": 101.224, "spec": {"shot": "problems", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 10 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.108, 0.228], ["then", 0.229, 0.538], ["slowly", 1.035, 1.801], ["the", 1.815, 1.922], ["problems", 1.922, 2.379], ["start", 2.379, 2.782]]}, {"text": "Ten years later, your friends start to notice. They have their first wrinkles and their first gray hairs. You look exactly the same.", "start": 101.924, "end": 110.876, "spec": {"shot": "tenyears", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 10 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Ten", 0.121, 0.336], ["years", 0.349, 0.618], ["later", 0.632, 1.048], ["your", 1.492, 1.613], ["friends", 1.613, 2.07], ["start", 2.07, 2.258], ["to", 2.258, 2.312], ["notice", 2.312, 2.944], ["They", 3.387, 3.441], ["have", 3.441, 3.602], ["their", 3.616, 3.763], ["first", 3.777, 4.261], ["wrinkles", 4.274, 4.96], ["and", 5.108, 5.228], ["their", 5.229, 5.349], ["first", 5.363, 5.887], ["gray", 5.901, 6.237], ["hairs", 6.237, 6.868], ["You", 7.312, 7.379], ["look", 7.379, 7.5], ["exactly", 7.5, 8.038], ["the", 8.051, 8.132], ["same", 8.132, 8.562]]}, {"text": "At first they joke about it. Then they stop joking. People start whispering behind your back.", "start": 111.576, "end": 117.264, "spec": {"shot": "whisper", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 12 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.108, 0.188], ["first", 0.202, 0.47], ["they", 0.47, 0.578], ["joke", 0.591, 0.901], ["about", 0.901, 1.183], ["it", 1.183, 1.358], ["Then", 1.788, 1.855], ["they", 1.855, 1.949], ["stop", 1.949, 2.271], ["joking", 2.272, 2.809], ["People", 3.253, 3.521], ["start", 3.522, 3.804], ["whispering", 3.817, 4.341], ["behind", 4.355, 4.731], ["your", 4.745, 4.839], ["back", 4.852, 5.323]]}, {"text": "Your best friend turns forty and throws a huge party. And you still get asked for your ID at the door.", "start": 117.964, "end": 125.044, "spec": {"shot": "party40", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 15 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.108, 0.215], ["best", 0.215, 0.524], ["friend", 0.524, 0.833], ["turns", 0.833, 1.142], ["forty", 1.142, 1.788], ["and", 1.989, 2.204], ["throws", 2.392, 2.849], ["a", 2.849, 2.89], ["huge", 2.903, 3.508], ["party", 3.508, 3.938], ["And", 4.368, 4.462], ["you", 4.476, 4.543], ["still", 4.543, 4.772], ["get", 4.771, 4.919], ["asked", 4.919, 5.228], ["for", 5.229, 5.336], ["your", 5.336, 5.47], ["ID", 5.484, 5.968], ["at", 5.981, 6.102], ["the", 6.116, 6.21], ["door", 6.223, 6.68]]}, {"text": "So you start lying. Botox. Great genes. A really strict skincare routine. And every lie needs another lie.", "start": 125.744, "end": 134.384, "spec": {"shot": "lies", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 14 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.202], ["you", 0.202, 0.296], ["start", 0.309, 0.632], ["lying", 0.645, 1.075], ["Botox", 1.519, 2.191], ["Great", 2.634, 2.93], ["genes", 2.93, 3.548], ["A", 3.978, 4.046], ["really", 4.046, 4.355], ["strict", 4.355, 4.852], ["skincare", 4.866, 5.43], ["routine", 5.444, 5.954], ["And", 6.384, 6.546], ["every", 6.573, 6.828], ["lie", 6.841, 7.164], ["needs", 7.177, 7.554], ["another", 7.554, 7.876], ["lie", 7.876, 8.266]]}, {"text": "Then your parents get old. You sit next to them in the hospital, and the nurse thinks you're their grandson.", "start": 135.084, "end": 140.724, "spec": {"shot": "parents", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 25 · LOOKS 25", "mood": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.108, 0.175], ["your", 0.175, 0.269], ["parents", 0.282, 0.632], ["get", 0.632, 0.78], ["old", 0.78, 1.129], ["You", 1.559, 1.68], ["sit", 1.68, 1.922], ["next", 1.935, 2.164], ["to", 2.164, 2.218], ["them", 2.218, 2.366], ["in", 2.366, 2.419], ["the", 2.419, 2.46], ["hospital", 2.46, 3.118], ["and", 3.535, 3.602], ["the", 3.602, 3.683], ["nurse", 3.683, 4.113], ["thinks", 4.113, 4.368], ["you're", 4.368, 4.449], ["their", 4.462, 4.597], ["grandson", 4.597, 5.255]]}, {"text": "At the funeral, people who have known you your whole life don't recognize you. They think you're some distant relative.", "start": 141.424, "end": 148.288, "spec": {"shot": "funeral", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 27 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.108, 0.202], ["the", 0.202, 0.269], ["funeral", 0.269, 0.914], ["people", 1.331, 1.613], ["who", 1.613, 1.707], ["have", 1.707, 1.815], ["known", 1.815, 2.11], ["you", 2.124, 2.258], ["your", 2.258, 2.419], ["whole", 2.433, 2.715], ["life", 2.715, 3.199], ["don't", 3.333, 3.602], ["recognize", 3.602, 4.207], ["you", 4.207, 4.449], ["They", 4.892, 4.987], ["think", 4.987, 5.175], ["you're", 5.175, 5.269], ["some", 5.269, 5.457], ["distant", 5.47, 5.887], ["relative", 5.901, 6.492]]}, {"text": "Love gets complicated too. You fall in love, but every year, your partner gets a little older, and you don't.", "start": 148.988, "end": 156.068, "spec": {"shot": "dating", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 30 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Love", 0.094, 0.269], ["gets", 0.269, 0.43], ["complicated", 0.43, 1.129], ["too", 1.142, 1.532], ["You", 1.962, 2.07], ["fall", 2.083, 2.339], ["in", 2.339, 2.419], ["love", 2.419, 2.849], ["but", 3.105, 3.266], ["every", 3.28, 3.616], ["year", 3.616, 4.099], ["your", 4.355, 4.462], ["partner", 4.462, 4.785], ["gets", 4.785, 4.919], ["a", 4.919, 4.96], ["little", 4.96, 5.296], ["older", 5.309, 5.806], ["and", 6.089, 6.169], ["you", 6.169, 6.263], ["don't", 6.277, 6.694]]}, {"text": "After twenty years, a waiter asks if she's your mom. Every time it happens, it hurts a little more.", "start": 156.768, "end": 163.704, "spec": {"shot": "motherson", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 45 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["After", 0.108, 0.336], ["twenty", 0.336, 0.645], ["years", 0.645, 1.223], ["a", 1.425, 1.505], ["waiter", 1.505, 1.895], ["asks", 1.895, 2.46], ["if", 2.581, 2.675], ["she's", 2.675, 2.97], ["your", 2.97, 3.064], ["mom", 3.078, 3.427], ["Every", 3.871, 4.059], ["time", 4.059, 4.288], ["it", 4.288, 4.341], ["happens", 4.341, 4.987], ["it", 5.39, 5.47], ["hurts", 5.484, 5.726], ["a", 5.726, 5.78], ["little", 5.78, 6.062], ["more", 6.062, 6.532]]}, {"text": "She starts to feel it too. She looks at her wrinkles in the mirror, then she looks at you. And something between you quietly breaks.", "start": 164.404, "end": 173.572, "spec": {"shot": "mirror2", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 46 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["She", 0.121, 0.242], ["starts", 0.255, 0.524], ["to", 0.538, 0.618], ["feel", 0.618, 0.941], ["it", 0.954, 1.035], ["too", 1.048, 1.452], ["She", 1.882, 2.056], ["looks", 2.056, 2.298], ["at", 2.312, 2.366], ["her", 2.366, 2.607], ["wrinkles", 2.621, 3.118], ["in", 3.118, 3.185], ["the", 3.199, 3.266], ["mirror", 3.266, 3.75], ["then", 4.288, 4.409], ["she", 4.409, 4.583], ["looks", 4.583, 4.879], ["at", 4.879, 5.013], ["you", 5.013, 5.323], ["And", 5.753, 5.914], ["something", 6.358, 6.734], ["between", 6.747, 7.258], ["you", 7.258, 7.554], ["quietly", 7.567, 8.091], ["breaks", 8.105, 8.763]]}, {"text": "Even normal life stops working. Your ID says you're fifty, but your face says twenty-five. Banks, doctors, employers. Everyone gets suspicious.", "start": 174.272, "end": 185.504, "spec": {"shot": "paperwork", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 50 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Even", 0.081, 0.282], ["normal", 0.296, 0.685], ["life", 0.685, 1.196], ["stops", 1.358, 1.774], ["working", 1.788, 2.231], ["Your", 2.675, 2.796], ["ID", 2.796, 3.306], ["says", 3.32, 3.562], ["you're", 3.562, 3.656], ["fifty", 3.669, 4.301], ["but", 4.556, 4.677], ["your", 4.691, 4.812], ["face", 4.812, 5.296], ["says", 5.309, 5.806], ["twenty-five", 5.82, 6.68], ["Banks", 7.124, 7.54], ["doctors", 7.648, 8.159], ["employers", 8.159, 8.978], ["Everyone", 9.395, 9.758], ["gets", 9.771, 9.946], ["suspicious", 9.946, 10.86]]}, {"text": "Try explaining to a doctor why your scans look twenty-five, when your file says you should be sixty.", "start": 186.204, "end": 193.356, "spec": {"shot": "doctor", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 60 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Try", 0.108, 0.309], ["explaining", 0.309, 0.712], ["to", 0.712, 0.833], ["a", 0.833, 0.901], ["doctor", 0.914, 1.478], ["why", 1.492, 1.814], ["your", 1.828, 2.003], ["scans", 2.003, 2.608], ["look", 2.621, 2.823], ["twenty-five", 2.823, 3.642], ["when", 4.059, 4.18], ["your", 4.18, 4.315], ["file", 4.314, 4.892], ["says", 5.309, 5.618], ["you", 5.618, 5.699], ["should", 5.699, 5.901], ["be", 5.901, 6.021], ["sixty", 6.035, 6.747]]}, {"text": "You start avoiding cameras. Every old photo of you is evidence. One picture from the past could expose everything.", "start": 194.056, "end": 201.904, "spec": {"shot": "photos", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 50 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.188], ["start", 0.188, 0.43], ["avoiding", 0.43, 0.847], ["cameras", 0.847, 1.519], ["Every", 1.949, 2.231], ["old", 2.231, 2.487], ["photo", 2.487, 2.917], ["of", 2.93, 2.997], ["you", 2.997, 3.266], ["is", 3.468, 3.656], ["evidence", 3.656, 4.301], ["One", 4.731, 4.919], ["picture", 4.919, 5.269], ["from", 5.282, 5.417], ["the", 5.417, 5.497], ["past", 5.511, 6.062], ["could", 6.142, 6.29], ["expose", 6.304, 6.909], ["everything", 6.922, 7.473]]}, {"text": "So you do the only thing you can. You pack one suitcase, leave in the middle of the night, and start over in a new city with a new name.", "start": 202.604, "end": 210.884, "spec": {"shot": "move", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 52 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.215], ["you", 0.229, 0.323], ["do", 0.336, 0.497], ["the", 0.497, 0.632], ["only", 0.632, 0.887], ["thing", 0.887, 1.169], ["you", 1.169, 1.29], ["can", 1.29, 1.707], ["You", 2.124, 2.218], ["pack", 2.218, 2.54], ["one", 2.54, 2.809], ["suitcase", 2.823, 3.737], ["leave", 4.005, 4.288], ["in", 4.288, 4.341], ["the", 4.341, 4.395], ["middle", 4.395, 4.691], ["of", 4.704, 4.758], ["the", 4.758, 4.825], ["night", 4.825, 5.188], ["and", 5.605, 5.672], ["start", 5.672, 5.995], ["over", 6.008, 6.344], ["in", 6.344, 6.425], ["a", 6.425, 6.452], ["new", 6.452, 6.747], ["city", 6.747, 7.137], ["with", 7.137, 7.298], ["a", 7.298, 7.312], ["new", 7.325, 7.554], ["name", 7.554, 7.917]]}, {"text": "No goodbyes. No explanations. Your friends just wake up one day, and you're gone.", "start": 211.584, "end": 217.56, "spec": {"shot": "burn", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 52 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["No", 0.108, 0.242], ["goodbyes", 0.242, 0.86], ["No", 1.304, 1.505], ["explanations", 1.519, 2.46], ["Your", 2.89, 2.984], ["friends", 2.984, 3.387], ["just", 3.387, 3.602], ["wake", 3.602, 3.804], ["up", 3.804, 3.978], ["one", 3.978, 4.234], ["day", 4.234, 4.624], ["and", 4.987, 5.134], ["you're", 5.148, 5.242], ["gone", 5.255, 5.605]]}, {"text": "And from far away, you watch the people you left behind get old, get sick, and die. And you're not allowed to be there.", "start": 218.26, "end": 226.276, "spec": {"shot": "faraway", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 70 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.175], ["from", 0.188, 0.349], ["far", 0.363, 0.699], ["away", 0.699, 1.196], ["you", 1.68, 1.801], ["watch", 1.801, 2.097], ["the", 2.097, 2.191], ["people", 2.204, 2.5], ["you", 2.5, 2.621], ["left", 2.621, 2.863], ["behind", 2.876, 3.333], ["get", 3.333, 3.508], ["old", 3.522, 3.925], ["get", 4.14, 4.328], ["sick", 4.328, 4.852], ["and", 5.094, 5.161], ["die", 5.175, 5.672], ["And", 6.089, 6.169], ["you're", 6.183, 6.263], ["not", 6.263, 6.519], ["allowed", 6.519, 6.949], ["to", 6.962, 7.043], ["be", 7.043, 7.218], ["there", 7.231, 7.607]]}, {"text": "And you have to do it again every ten or fifteen years. New city. New friends. New life. Again and again.", "start": 226.976, "end": 235.976, "spec": {"shot": "moves", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 100 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.202], ["you", 0.202, 0.282], ["have", 0.296, 0.43], ["to", 0.444, 0.511], ["do", 0.511, 0.699], ["it", 0.699, 0.766], ["again", 0.766, 1.169], ["every", 1.371, 1.707], ["ten", 1.707, 2.151], ["or", 2.366, 2.473], ["fifteen", 2.473, 3.038], ["years", 3.051, 3.562], ["New", 4.005, 4.22], ["city", 4.234, 4.718], ["New", 5.148, 5.323], ["friends", 5.323, 5.954], ["New", 6.384, 6.546], ["life", 6.559, 7.043], ["Again", 7.487, 7.944], ["and", 8.091, 8.185], ["again", 8.185, 8.602]]}, {"text": "After a while, you stop letting people in. What's the point of making friends if you'll have to leave them anyway?", "start": 236.676, "end": 243.084, "spec": {"shot": "walls", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 110 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["After", 0.108, 0.39], ["a", 0.39, 0.444], ["while", 0.444, 0.86], ["you", 1.331, 1.411], ["stop", 1.425, 1.774], ["letting", 1.788, 2.016], ["people", 2.016, 2.379], ["in", 2.379, 2.594], ["What's", 3.038, 3.172], ["the", 3.172, 3.28], ["point", 3.28, 3.521], ["of", 3.522, 3.589], ["making", 3.602, 3.938], ["friends", 3.952, 4.503], ["if", 4.597, 4.704], ["you'll", 4.704, 4.812], ["have", 4.812, 4.973], ["to", 4.973, 5.054], ["leave", 5.054, 5.336], ["them", 5.336, 5.457], ["anyway", 5.457, 6.008]]}, {"text": "You learn to fake it. You pretend to be tired. You pretend your back hurts. You even paint on a few wrinkles.", "start": 243.784, "end": 250.648, "spec": {"shot": "fake", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 115 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.215], ["learn", 0.215, 0.403], ["to", 0.403, 0.47], ["fake", 0.484, 0.887], ["it", 0.887, 1.075], ["You", 1.519, 1.599], ["pretend", 1.599, 1.935], ["to", 1.935, 1.976], ["be", 1.989, 2.097], ["tired", 2.097, 2.581], ["You", 3.024, 3.105], ["pretend", 3.105, 3.401], ["your", 3.414, 3.481], ["back", 3.495, 3.763], ["hurts", 3.777, 4.288], ["You", 4.731, 4.812], ["even", 4.812, 5.027], ["paint", 5.027, 5.282], ["on", 5.282, 5.39], ["a", 5.403, 5.444], ["few", 5.457, 5.833], ["wrinkles", 5.833, 6.465]]}, {"text": "Every conversation is a test. Where did you grow up? Who are your parents? Why do you remember things nobody your age should know?", "start": 251.348, "end": 259.628, "spec": {"shot": "story", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 120 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Every", 0.094, 0.296], ["conversation", 0.296, 1.116], ["is", 1.237, 1.384], ["a", 1.384, 1.438], ["test", 1.438, 2.016], ["Where", 2.46, 2.527], ["did", 2.54, 2.634], ["you", 2.634, 2.702], ["grow", 2.702, 2.984], ["up", 2.984, 3.172], ["Who", 3.616, 3.683], ["are", 3.696, 3.763], ["your", 3.777, 3.871], ["parents", 3.871, 4.503], ["Why", 4.933, 5.04], ["do", 5.04, 5.094], ["you", 5.094, 5.215], ["remember", 5.229, 5.578], ["things", 5.578, 5.914], ["nobody", 5.914, 6.357], ["your", 6.371, 6.613], ["age", 6.626, 7.11], ["should", 7.258, 7.513], ["know", 7.527, 7.876]]}, {"text": "And then something even worse shows up. Boredom. You've seen every kind of movie, heard every kind of song, had every kind of argument.", "start": 260.328, "end": 269.064, "spec": {"shot": "bored", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 150 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.161], ["then", 0.161, 0.296], ["something", 0.309, 0.685], ["even", 0.699, 1.021], ["worse", 1.022, 1.492], ["shows", 1.505, 1.962], ["up", 1.962, 2.245], ["Boredom", 2.688, 3.064], ["You've", 3.468, 3.575], ["seen", 3.575, 3.898], ["every", 3.911, 4.207], ["kind", 4.22, 4.422], ["of", 4.422, 4.476], ["movie", 4.476, 5.0], ["heard", 5.269, 5.47], ["every", 5.605, 5.86], ["kind", 5.86, 6.062], ["of", 6.062, 6.129], ["song", 6.129, 6.573], ["had", 7.003, 7.151], ["every", 7.231, 7.513], ["kind", 7.513, 7.728], ["of", 7.729, 7.782], ["argument", 7.782, 8.347]]}, {"text": "Nothing surprises you anymore. And without surprises, even happiness starts to feel flat.", "start": 269.764, "end": 276.46, "spec": {"shot": "flat", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 160 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Nothing", 0.108, 0.309], ["surprises", 0.323, 0.847], ["you", 0.847, 0.981], ["anymore", 0.995, 1.519], ["And", 1.962, 2.11], ["without", 2.124, 2.487], ["surprises", 2.487, 3.293], ["even", 3.777, 4.032], ["happiness", 4.032, 4.772], ["starts", 4.96, 5.296], ["to", 5.309, 5.39], ["feel", 5.39, 5.766], ["flat", 5.766, 6.317]]}, {"text": "Your memories start to blur. One day you realize you can't remember the face of your first love anymore. Or your mother's voice.", "start": 277.16, "end": 285.752, "spec": {"shot": "forget", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 180 · LOOKS 25", "mood": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.108, 0.202], ["memories", 0.202, 0.847], ["start", 0.995, 1.21], ["to", 1.21, 1.263], ["blur", 1.263, 1.747], ["One", 2.191, 2.433], ["day", 2.433, 2.634], ["you", 2.634, 2.863], ["realize", 2.876, 3.548], ["you", 3.656, 3.79], ["can't", 3.79, 4.14], ["remember", 4.153, 4.597], ["the", 4.597, 4.677], ["face", 4.677, 5.121], ["of", 5.121, 5.188], ["your", 5.188, 5.282], ["first", 5.282, 5.753], ["love", 5.753, 6.089], ["anymore", 6.089, 6.626], ["Or", 7.056, 7.137], ["your", 7.137, 7.218], ["mother's", 7.231, 7.554], ["voice", 7.554, 8.199]]}, {"text": "And hiding gets harder and harder. Cameras everywhere. Face recognition. Digital records of everything.", "start": 286.452, "end": 293.82, "spec": {"shot": "scan", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 200 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.188], ["hiding", 0.188, 0.564], ["gets", 0.565, 0.726], ["harder", 0.739, 1.304], ["and", 1.317, 1.398], ["harder", 1.398, 1.922], ["Cameras", 2.352, 2.769], ["everywhere", 2.782, 3.427], ["Face", 3.952, 4.194], ["recognition", 4.194, 4.866], ["Digital", 5.309, 5.766], ["records", 5.766, 6.263], ["of", 6.263, 6.358], ["everything", 6.371, 6.976]]}, {"text": "You know exactly what would happen if anyone found out. You wouldn't be a celebrity. You'd be a science experiment.", "start": 294.52, "end": 302.104, "spec": {"shot": "lab", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 200 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.108, 0.188], ["know", 0.188, 0.323], ["exactly", 0.323, 0.995], ["what", 1.089, 1.196], ["would", 1.196, 1.317], ["happen", 1.331, 1.828], ["if", 2.137, 2.271], ["anyone", 2.392, 2.755], ["found", 2.755, 3.105], ["out", 3.105, 3.454], ["You", 3.898, 3.978], ["wouldn't", 3.992, 4.167], ["be", 4.167, 4.314], ["a", 4.314, 4.368], ["celebrity", 4.368, 5.027], ["You'd", 5.47, 5.578], ["be", 5.578, 5.699], ["a", 5.699, 5.753], ["science", 5.753, 6.384], ["experiment", 6.398, 7.177]]}, {"text": "So you carry the biggest secret in the world, completely alone. There's literally nobody you can tell.", "start": 302.804, "end": 309.38, "spec": {"shot": "secret", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 220 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.215], ["you", 0.215, 0.336], ["carry", 0.349, 0.753], ["the", 0.753, 0.927], ["biggest", 1.035, 1.452], ["secret", 1.465, 1.909], ["in", 1.909, 1.962], ["the", 1.962, 2.043], ["world", 2.043, 2.527], ["completely", 2.93, 3.548], ["alone", 3.548, 4.005], ["There's", 4.436, 4.61], ["literally", 4.61, 5.013], ["nobody", 5.013, 5.497], ["you", 5.511, 5.632], ["can", 5.645, 5.753], ["tell", 5.753, 6.183]]}, {"text": "Some nights you lie awake, wishing for one tiny thing. A single gray hair.", "start": 310.08, "end": 316.104, "spec": {"shot": "grayhair", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 250 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Some", 0.094, 0.282], ["nights", 0.282, 0.578], ["you", 0.591, 0.699], ["lie", 0.699, 0.914], ["awake", 0.914, 1.452], ["wishing", 1.841, 2.379], ["for", 2.379, 2.621], ["one", 2.621, 3.051], ["tiny", 3.064, 3.468], ["thing", 3.481, 4.073], ["A", 4.516, 4.57], ["single", 4.583, 4.933], ["gray", 4.933, 5.202], ["hair", 5.202, 5.632]]}, {"text": "Decades turn into centuries. Everyone you ever loved is gone. Only you remain.", "start": 316.804, "end": 322.996, "spec": {"shot": "gone", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Decades", 0.094, 0.793], ["turn", 1.035, 1.425], ["into", 1.425, 1.599], ["centuries", 1.599, 2.487], ["Everyone", 2.917, 3.28], ["you", 3.28, 3.387], ["ever", 3.387, 3.696], ["loved", 3.696, 4.059], ["is", 4.073, 4.18], ["gone", 4.194, 4.597], ["Only", 5.027, 5.242], ["you", 5.242, 5.376], ["remain", 5.39, 5.806]]}, {"text": "Sure, that little investment has turned into a fortune by now. But there's nobody left to spend it with.", "start": 323.696, "end": 330.224, "spec": {"shot": "fortune", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Sure", 0.108, 0.524], ["that", 0.82, 1.008], ["little", 1.022, 1.25], ["investment", 1.25, 1.935], ["has", 1.949, 2.164], ["turned", 2.164, 2.5], ["into", 2.513, 2.728], ["a", 2.728, 2.782], ["fortune", 2.796, 3.306], ["by", 3.32, 3.468], ["now", 3.468, 3.952], ["But", 4.382, 4.462], ["there's", 4.462, 4.624], ["nobody", 4.624, 4.987], ["left", 4.987, 5.269], ["to", 5.282, 5.363], ["spend", 5.363, 5.699], ["it", 5.712, 5.78], ["with", 5.78, 6.142]]}, {"text": "And you start to envy them. The people who got old. They got a whole story, with a beginning, a middle, and an end.", "start": 330.924, "end": 338.676, "spec": {"shot": "envyold", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.202], ["you", 0.202, 0.282], ["start", 0.282, 0.511], ["to", 0.511, 0.591], ["envy", 0.591, 0.901], ["them", 0.901, 1.169], ["The", 1.613, 1.667], ["people", 1.667, 1.962], ["who", 1.962, 2.056], ["got", 2.056, 2.258], ["old", 2.258, 2.594], ["They", 3.024, 3.078], ["got", 3.078, 3.199], ["a", 3.212, 3.253], ["whole", 3.266, 3.683], ["story", 3.683, 4.274], ["with", 4.583, 4.758], ["a", 4.758, 4.812], ["beginning", 4.812, 5.363], ["a", 5.645, 5.672], ["middle", 5.686, 6.223], ["and", 6.801, 6.882], ["an", 6.882, 6.976], ["end", 6.976, 7.379]]}, {"text": "In roughly a billion years, scientists expect the Sun to be so bright that Earth becomes too hot for life.", "start": 339.376, "end": 346.72, "spec": {"shot": "hotearth", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "~1 BILLION YEARS"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.094, 0.215], ["roughly", 0.215, 0.551], ["a", 0.551, 0.618], ["billion", 0.618, 1.008], ["years", 1.008, 1.546], ["scientists", 1.828, 2.406], ["expect", 2.419, 2.836], ["the", 2.836, 2.903], ["Sun", 2.903, 3.199], ["to", 3.199, 3.266], ["be", 3.28, 3.414], ["so", 3.427, 3.804], ["bright", 3.898, 4.449], ["that", 4.718, 4.893], ["Earth", 5.013, 5.242], ["becomes", 5.242, 5.672], ["too", 5.686, 5.981], ["hot", 5.995, 6.29], ["for", 6.29, 6.452], ["life", 6.452, 6.949]]}, {"text": "And in about five billion years, the Sun swells into a red giant.", "start": 347.42, "end": 353.108, "spec": {"shot": "redgiant", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "~5 BILLION YEARS"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.202], ["in", 0.202, 0.269], ["about", 0.282, 0.565], ["five", 0.565, 1.156], ["billion", 1.169, 1.559], ["years", 1.559, 2.137], ["the", 2.366, 2.5], ["Sun", 2.5, 2.944], ["swells", 2.957, 3.804], ["into", 3.925, 4.22], ["a", 4.22, 4.288], ["red", 4.301, 4.718], ["giant", 4.718, 5.296]]}, {"text": "And you? You're still twenty-five.", "start": 353.808, "end": 356.328, "spec": {"shot": "alone", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.108, 0.228], ["you", 0.242, 0.497], ["You're", 0.914, 1.008], ["still", 1.022, 1.317], ["twenty-five", 1.317, 2.124]]}, {"text": "Maybe getting older isn't a bug. Maybe it's exactly what makes our time so valuable. Every birthday, every goodbye, every moment matters, because it doesn't last forever.", "start": 357.028, "end": 369.292, "spec": {"shot": "meaning", "era": "wonder", "chip": null, "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Maybe", 0.094, 0.323], ["getting", 0.336, 0.605], ["older", 0.618, 1.156], ["isn't", 1.304, 1.519], ["a", 1.519, 1.559], ["bug", 1.573, 1.976], ["Maybe", 2.406, 2.648], ["it's", 2.648, 2.755], ["exactly", 2.755, 3.387], ["what", 3.401, 3.535], ["makes", 3.548, 3.884], ["our", 3.884, 4.019], ["time", 4.019, 4.516], ["so", 4.852, 5.108], ["valuable", 5.108, 5.806], ["Every", 6.237, 6.478], ["birthday", 6.492, 7.258], ["every", 7.715, 7.984], ["goodbye", 7.997, 8.669], ["every", 9.167, 9.435], ["moment", 9.449, 9.798], ["matters", 9.798, 10.202], ["because", 10.215, 10.457], ["it", 10.457, 10.538], ["doesn't", 10.538, 10.833], ["last", 10.833, 11.21], ["forever", 11.21, 11.868]]}, {"text": "So, would you still take the deal? Living forever, but watching everyone you love leave?", "start": 369.992, "end": 375.824, "spec": {"shot": "deal", "era": "wonder", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.255], ["would", 0.269, 0.39], ["you", 0.39, 0.457], ["still", 0.457, 0.672], ["take", 0.672, 0.874], ["the", 0.874, 0.941], ["deal", 0.954, 1.344], ["Living", 1.761, 2.097], ["forever", 2.11, 2.755], ["but", 3.253, 3.401], ["watching", 3.414, 3.978], ["everyone", 4.099, 4.556], ["you", 4.556, 4.664], ["love", 4.677, 5.0], ["leave", 5.0, 5.47]]}, {"text": "Tell me in the comments. And if you want more what-if stories like this, subscribe.", "start": 376.524, "end": 381.42, "spec": {"shot": "outro", "era": "wonder", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["Tell", 0.108, 0.242], ["me", 0.255,